  "final_summary": "## 1. Sprint summary\n\n- Implemented Sprint 103 paper rotation warning closure, evidence-backed debate resolution, and multi-scenario replay calibration.\n- Closure status: PaperRotationWarningsClosedWithNotes.\n\n## 2. Why Sprint 103 was needed\n\n- Sprint 102 proved the first paper-only rotation worked, but it intentionally left warnings open. Sprint 103 closes those warnings without changing the committee-owned, paper-only, runtime-deferred architecture.\n\n## 3. Files added\n\n- Added Sprint 103 league layer, CLI commands, examples, fixtures, docs, focused tests, and test support.\n\n## 4. Files changed\n\n- Extended exports, CLI wiring, and test support on top of the existing Sprint 102 implementation.\n\n## 5. Paper rotation warning closure\n\n- Status: PaperRotationWarningsClosedWithNotes.\n- closed_warning_count=8 remaining_warning_count=3.\n\n## 6. Rotation plan warning closure\n\n- Status: RotationPlanWarningsClosed.\n- cross_group_debate_assignments=3.\n\n## 7. Member selection warning closure\n\n- Status: MemberSelectionWarningsClosedWithNotes.\n- selected_member_count=8 watchlist_members_used=SaylorTreasury.\n\n## 8. Lower-confidence evidence closure\n\n- Status: LowerConfidenceEvidenceClosedWithWarnings.\n- still_warning_backed_count=3 silent_upgrade_count=0.\n\n## 9. Wonyotti warning closure\n\n- Status: WonyottiStillWarningBacked.\n- exact_return_claims_blocked=true.\n\n## 10. Larry Williams warning closure\n\n- Status: LarryWilliamsStillWarningBacked.\n- exact_numeric_rule_claims_downweighted=true.\n\n## 11. Arthur Hayes warning closure\n\n- Status: ArthurHayesStillWarningBacked.\n- leverage_risk_guard_present=true.\n\n## 12. Proposal run warning closure\n\n- Status: ProposalRunWarningsClosed.\n- proposal_count=7.\n\n## 13. Entry timing warning closure\n\n- Status: EntryTimingWarningsClosedWithNotes.\n- timing_proposal_count=7.\n\n## 14. Debate session warning closure\n\n- Status: DebateWarningsClosedWithNotes.\n- consensus_state=NeedMoreEvidence.\n\n## 15. NeedMoreEvidence resolution plan\n\n- Status: NeedMoreEvidencePlanReadyWithWarnings.\n- item_count=4.\n\n## 16. Cross-group conflict closure\n\n- Status: CrossGroupConflictsClosedWithNotes.\n- conflicts_detected=4.\n\n## 17. Chairman synthesis warning closure\n\n- Status: ChairmanSynthesisWarningsClosedWithNotes.\n- recommendation=NoTrade.\n\n## 18. Style weight audit warning closure\n\n- Status: StyleWeightWarningsClosed.\n- unsafe_weight_adjustment_count=0.\n\n## 19. Risk Governor handoff warning closure v2\n\n- Status: RiskHandoffWarningsClosedWithNotes.\n- veto_result=NoTrade.\n\n## 20. Paper trace / replay warning closure\n\n- trace_status=PaperTraceWarningsClosed replay_status=PaperReplayWarningsClosedWithNotes.\n\n## 21. Expectation and NoTrade/RiskDenied trace closure\n\n- expectation_status=ExpectationTraceWarningsClosed notrade_trace_status=NoTradeRiskDeniedWarningsClosedWithNotes.\n\n## 22. Regime routing and multi-expert coverage closure\n\n- routing_status=RegimeRoutingWarningsClosedWithNotes coverage_status=MultiExpertCoverageWarningsClosed.\n\n## 23. Paper roster usage closure\n\n- Status: PaperRosterUsageWarningsClosedWithNotes.\n- watchlist_members_used=SaylorTreasury.\n\n## 24. Watchlist member usage policy\n\n- Status: WatchlistUsagePolicyReady.\n- live_allowed=false.\n\n## 25. SaylorTreasury watchlist audit\n\n- Status: SaylorWatchlistUsageApprovedForPaper.\n- used_in_sprint102_rotation=true.\n\n## 26. Multi-scenario paper replay\n\n- Status: MultiScenarioReplayReady.\n- replay_count=7 no_trade_count=2 need_more_evidence_count=2.\n\n## 27. Scenario expectation matrix\n\n- Status: ExpectationMatrixReady.\n- scenario_count=7.\n\n## 28. Committee decision stability\n\n- Status: DecisionStabilityReady.\n- unstable_count=0.\n\n## 29. NoTrade and NeedMoreEvidence justification\n\n- no_trade_status=NoTradeJustificationReady need_more_evidence_status=NeedMoreEvidenceJustificationReadyWithWarnings.\n\n## 30. Risk Governor NoTrade reason audit\n\n- Status: NoTradeReasonAuditReady.\n- no_trade_veto_count=1.\n\n## 31. Paper rotation readiness gate v2\n\n- Status: PaperRotationReadyWithWarnings.\n- paper_rotation_ready=true live_rotation_allowed=false.\n\n## 32. Workspace acceptance truth v4\n\n- Status: WorkspaceTruthStillOpen.\n- can_claim_full_acceptance=false.\n\n## 33. Safety coverage preservation v19\n\n- Status: SafetyCoveragePreserved.\n- no_silent_confidence_upgrade_guard_present=true.\n\n## 34. Control Tower paper rotation closure panel\n\n- Built a static/read-only control tower closure panel with no train/runtime/live/order/account/browser controls and no activate-all-18-live control.\n\n## 35. Output bundle\n\n- Output files: 38.\n\n## 36. CLI and examples\n\n- Added Sprint 103 warning-closure commands over a single local-only config surface with explicit research-only, paper-only, warning-closure-only, and safety warnings.\n\n## 37. Tests added\n\n- Added focused Sprint 103 closure, replay, justification, CLI safety, and determinism tests.\n\n## 38. Test results\n\n- See validation commands run after implementation; full workspace truth remains reported separately from focused Sprint 103 validation.\n\n## 39. Paper rotation closure status\n\n- PaperRotationWarningsClosedWithNotes.\n\n## 40. Lower-confidence evidence status\n\n- LowerConfidenceEvidenceClosedWithWarnings.\n\n## 41. Debate resolution status\n\n- DebateWarningsClosedWithNotes.\n\n## 42. Risk Governor handoff status\n\n- RiskHandoffWarningsClosedWithNotes.\n\n## 43. Paper readiness status\n\n- PaperRotationReadyWithWarnings.\n\n## 44. Runtime deferred status\n\n- RuntimeStillDeferred\n- TrainingStillDeferred\n- LiveInferenceForbidden\n- LiveTradingForbidden\n- NoRuntimeLlmLiveDecisionPath\n- KeepResearchOnly\n- KeepPaperOnly\n\n## 45. Workspace acceptance truth status\n\n- FullWorkspaceNotRun.\n\n## 46. Safety coverage status\n\n- SafetyCoveragePreserved.\n\n## 47. Risk review\n\n- Chairman cannot bypass Risk Governor. Risk Governor remains final veto. Paper proposals remain paper semantics only and never become orders or live execution authority.\n\n## 48. Deferred items\n\n- Runtime inference, model training, live inference, live trading, broker/order/account, runtime LLM live decision path, Mamba runtime, Gated runtime, dashboard serve, browser execution, and 18-live-agent activation remain deferred or forbidden.\n\n## 49. Next gstack sprint recommendation\n\n- Keep the paper committee conservative, continue evidence closure without silent upgrades, and pursue full workspace acceptance separately from paper rotation readiness.\n\n",
